\ TREE HANDLING IN FORTH                                                                                                         Source code for article in SIGForth Newsletter Vol.3 No.1       entitled "Coroutines and Recursion for Tree Balancing"                                                                          Rick Hoselton                                                   7714 Kellwood                                                   Houston, Tezas 77040                                            713/466-1866                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \ Load Screen ...                                                                                                                 2 11 THRU                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     \ F83 Compatibility ...                                                                                                          : \\                                                                1024  >IN  !  ;  IMMEDIATE                                                                                                  : STRCMP  ( addr1  len1  addr2  len2 -- flag )                      ROT  2SWAP  2OVER  MIN  COMP  DUP                               IF    -ROT  2DROP                                               ELSE  DROP  SWAP  -                                             THEN  ;                                                                                                                     : X"                                                                ASCII  "  WORD  DUP  C@  1+  ALLOT  ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                      \ SP@  and  SP! ...                                                                                                              BGET  ASM                          \ LMI FORTH ONLY                                                                             CODE  SP@  ( -- n )                \ repair for LMI                BX  PUSH                        \ save TOS                      BX,  SP  MOV                    \ access stack pointer          NEXT,  END-CODE                                                                                                              CODE  SP!  ( n -- )                \ repair for LMI                SP,  BX  MOV                    \ set stack pointer             BX  POP                         \ reset TOS                     NEXT,  END-CODE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             \ NODE FORMAT ...                                                                                                                CREATE  TREEPLACE  5000  ALLOT     \ nodes are stored here      VARIABLE  TREETOP                  \ points at top node         VARIABLE  TREE.HERE                \ tree allocation pointer                                                                    : TREE-ALLOT  ( # bytes -- 'node )                                  TREE.HERE  DUP  @  TREEPLACE                                    +  -ROT  +!  ;                                              : }LEFT    ( 'node -- 'leftpointer )                                (  0  +  )  ;                                               : }RIGHT   ( 'node -- 'rightpointer )                               4  +  ;                                                     : }STRING  ( 'node -- 'string )                                     8  +  ;                                                                                                                    \ TREE.INSERT ...                                                                                                                : NODE.LENGTH  ( 'string -- #bytes )                                C@  1+  }STRING  ;                                          : MAKE.NODE  ( 'string -- 'node )                                   DUP  NODE.LENGTH  TREE-ALLOT                                    TUCK  }STRING  OVER  C@  1+  CMOVE                              0  OVER  }RIGHT  !  0  OVER  }LEFT  !  ;                    : LESS.NODE?  ( 'string  'node -- flag )                            }STRING  COUNT  ROT  }STRING  COUNT  STRCMP  0>  ;          : TREE.INSERT  ( 'string  -- )                                      MAKE.NODE  TREETOP                                              BEGIN  DUP  @                                                   WHILE  @  2DUP  LESS.NODE?                                             IF  }LEFT  ELSE }RIGHT  THEN                             REPEAT  !  ;                                               \ TREE.LOCATE ...                                                : REFLAG  ( node addr1 len1 addr@ len2 -- node flag )               STRCMP                                                          DUP  0>  IF  DROP  }LEFT   FALSE  EXIT  THEN                         0<  IF        }RIGHT  FALSE  EXIT  THEN                    TRUE  ;                                                                                                                     : NODECOMPARE  ( 'string node -- string node' flag )                DUP  IF    2DUP  }STRING  COUNT                                            ROT  COUNT  REFLAG                                        ELSE  TRUE                                                      THEN  ;                                                                                                                : TREE.LOCATE  ( 'string -- node|)                                  TREETOP  BEGIN  @  NODECOMPARE                                           UNTIL  NIP  ;                                     \ COUNT-NODES ...                                                                                                                : INSERTS  ( n -- )                                                 TREETOP  OFF  TREE.HERE  OFF  0                                 DO  BL  WORD  TREE.INSERT  LOOP ;                                                                                           : COUNT.NODES  ( 'tree -- #nodes )                                  DUP                                                             IF   DUP  }LEFT  @         \ 'tree  'left.subtree                    RECURSE               \ 'tree  #left.subnodes                   SWAP  }RIGHT  @       \ # lt.subnodes  'rt.subtree              RECURSE               \ # lt.subnodes  #rt.subnodes             +  1+                 \ #nodes                             THEN  ;                    \ null pointer returns a zero                                                                                                                                   \ SHOWTREE ...                                                                                                                   : (SHOWTREE)  ( indent  'node  -- )                                 @  DUP                                                          IF   OVER  2+  OVER                                                  }LEFT  RECURSE                                                  CR  OVER  SPACES  DUP  }STRING                                  COUNT  TYPE  SWAP  2+  SWAP                                     }RIGHT  RECURSE                                            ELSE  2DROP                                                     THEN  ;                                                                                                                     : SHOWTREE  ( -- )                                                  0  TREETOP  (SHOWTREE)  ;                                                                                                  -->                                                             \ COROUTINE ...                                                                                                                  VARIABLE  CO.SP                    \ save inactive SP           CREATE  CO.RSTACK  4000  ALLOT     \ allocate RETURN STACK      CREATE  CO.USTACK  4000  ALLOT     \ allocate USER STACK        : COROUTINE  ( -- )                                                 RP@  SP@  CO.SP  @  SWAP                                        CO.SP  !  SP!  RP!  ;                                       : (COINITIALIZE)  ( 'body -- )     \ prestuff the stacks            CO.RSTACK  3996  +  TUCK  !                                     CO.USTACK  3996  +  TUCK  !                                     CO.SP  !  ;                                                 : COINITIALIZE  ( -- )             \ runs at compile time           '  >BODY  STATE  @                                              IF    [COMPILE]  LITERAL  COMPILE                               THEN  (COINITIALIZE)  ;  IMMEDIATE                         \ GET-NODES ...                                                                                                                  VARIABLE  NODE.HOLDER                                                                                                           : (PRESENT.NODES)  ( 'tree -- )                                     ?DUP                           \ if node exists, else 0         IF   DUP  }LEFT  @  RECURSE    \ present left subtree                DUP  NODE.HOLDER  !       \ save this node                      }RIGHT  @  COROUTINE      \ give up the node                    RECURSE                   \ present right subtree          THEN  ;                                                                                                                     : PRESENT.NODES  ( -- )                                             TREETOP  @  (PRESENT.NODES)  ;                                                                                                                                                             \ REBALANCE ...                                                                                                                 : REBALANCE  ( #nodes -- 'node )                                    DUP                                                             IF    1-  DUP  2/  TUCK  -  \ # rt.subnodes  #lt.subnodes             RECURSE               \ #rt.subnodes 'lt.subnode                COROUTINE             \ get node from PRESENT.NODES             NODE.HOLDER  @        \ #rt.nodes 'lt.node 'my.node             TUCK  }LEFT  !        \ #rt.nodes 'my.node                      SWAP  RECURSE         \ 'my.node 'rt.subnode                    OVER  }RIGHT  !       \ 'my.node                          THEN  ;                                                     : REBALANCE.TREE  ( -- )                                            COINITIALIZE  PRESENT.NODES                                     TREETOP  @  COUNT.NODES                                         REBALANCE  TREETOP  !  ;                                    \ INSERTS ...                                                                                                                    : (INSERTS)  ( #nodes -- 'node )                                    DUP                        \ #subnodes                          IF    1-  DUP  2/  TUCK  - \ #rt.subnodes #lt.subnodes                RECURSE              \ #rt.subnodes 'lt.subnode                 BL  WORD  MAKE.NODE  \ #right 'left 'this.node                  TUCK  }LEFT  !       \ #rt.subnodes 'this.node                  SWAP  RECURSE        \ 'this.node 'rt.subnode                   OVER  }RIGHT         \ 'this.node                         THEN  ;                                                                                                                     : INSERTS  ( n -- )                                                 TREE.HERE  OFF  (INSERTS)                                       TREETOP  !  ;                                                                                                              \ UNORDERED INSERTS  ...                                                                                                        20  INSERTS                                                                                                                     MARSHA      FRED        PETE        JOHN        LEM             HOWARD      TYRONE      CARRIE      SUSAN       MARIA           VANESSA     GRETCHEN    HELEN       DOUGLAS     MAXIMILLIAN     KAREN       EMILY       NATASHA     LARRY       DWIGHT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          \ ORDERED INSERTS ...                                                                                                           20  INSERTS                                                                                                                     CARRIE      DOUGLAS     DWIGHT      EMILY       FRED            GRETCHEN    HELEN       HOWARD      JOHN        KAREN           LARRY       LEM         MARIA       MARSHA      MAXIMILLIAN     NATASHA     PETE        SUSAN       TYRONE      VANESSA                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \ REVERSE ORDERED INSERTS ...                                                                                                   20  INSERTS                                                                                                                     VANESSA     TYRONE      SUSAN       PETE        NATASHA         MAXIMILLIAN MARSHA      MARIA       LEM         LARRY           KAREN       JOHN        HOWARD      HELEN       GRETCHEN        FRED        EMILY       DWIGHT      DOUGLAS         CARRIE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      